    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19073" root="سحر" body-key="s">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تسحّر</span></b>  (A, Mgh, Msb) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تسحّر السَّحُورَ</span>
(Az, TA) (tropical:)  <i>He ate the food,</i> or <i>meal,</i> [or <i>drank
the draught of milk,</i>] <i>called the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَحُور</span>. (Az, A,
Mgh, Msb, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تسحّر بِهِ</span> (tropical:)  <i>He ate it,</i>
(S, * K, * TA,) namely, food, or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَوِيق</span> [q. v.], [or
<i>drank it,</i> namely, milk,] <i>at the time called the</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَحَر</span>. (TA.)

